{"pickle":{"id":"1e0433c0-74e2-474e-b1fd-4fe718b5a734","uri":"features/ews_notify.feature","astNodeIds":["448d56a0-3ce6-4f6a-b2b7-09571d14cfc7","92e0294e-1478-4964-bc40-58dc504008bf"],"name":"An invalid notification is rejected: alert without properties","language":"en","steps":[{"id":"2834da87-5f11-4205-acb1-2d5c8f7a8e9c","text":"the \"notify\" endpoint","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["19c9113a-6640-4d6f-85d6-8fb5bb2f15c6"]},{"id":"411e4527-4400-4149-971c-f240b4985007","text":"a valid request","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["237873b4-f0e7-4a3c-97ba-1cc877d28c7f","92e0294e-1478-4964-bc40-58dc504008bf"]},{"id":"5c12828b-f663-408b-9051-d8aa3bf74ebe","text":"the request field \"message.notify_event.0.data\" becomes '{\"reg_record_type\":\"Alert\",\"reg_records\":[{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"geometry\":null}]}'","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["f6da2559-7a68-4af2-a300-7cdceb4f3bbc","92e0294e-1478-4964-bc40-58dc504008bf"]},{"id":"c6b1b9d5-c8b4-4f89-a4f1-fec7b82c03a5","text":"the request is sent","type":"Action","astNodeIds":["aaec6c74-eff8-4374-87f9-9fa53c41458d","92e0294e-1478-4964-bc40-58dc504008bf"]},{"id":"a6a5dceb-2e02-47dd-90b7-90801b187e84","text":"the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["55d4a8dc-bc36-41fd-9818-722b63442721","92e0294e-1478-4964-bc40-58dc504008bf"]}],"tags":[{"name":"@method=POST","astNodeId":"6f984a8c-de75-46ee-8159-b1132c919174"},{"name":"@endpoint=ews/notify","astNodeId":"fb5e9415-1ed2-4290-b2df-e8cf7c626e48"},{"name":"@negative","astNodeId":"2b96eb69-21b2-4d73-8aab-da17141a0ba1"},{"name":"@strict-data","astNodeId":"b007de21-d54d-45e5-82a8-3b5374e32585"}]}}
{"source":{"data":"@method=POST @endpoint=ews/on-subscribe\nFeature: Receive the subscription result (POST /on-subscribe)\n\nExposed by the SP system. After a subscribe request the EWS sends the result here: one\nsubscription code per accepted subscription, or a rejection with its reason. The suite plays\nthe EWS; the SP system must acknowledge valid results and refuse invalid ones.\n\n  Background:\n    Given the \"on-subscribe\" endpoint\n\n  @smoke\n  Scenario: A confirmed subscription is acknowledged\n    Given an on-subscribe callback confirming the subscription\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-subscribe\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the HTTP status should be 200\n    And the response should have a JSON content type\n    And the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario Outline: A rejected subscription (<code>) is acknowledged\n    Given an on-subscribe callback rejected with reason code \"<code>\"\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-subscribe\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n    Examples:\n      | code                          |\n      | rjct.reference_id.invalid     |\n      | rjct.filter.invalid           |\n      | rjct.notify_types.invalid     |\n      | rjct.event.already_subscribed |\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario Outline: An invalid subscription result is rejected: <case>\n    Given an on-subscribe callback confirming the subscription\n    And the request field \"<field>\" becomes '<value>'\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model\n\n    Examples:\n      | case                        | field                                                     | value          |\n      | wrong action                | header.action                                             | \"subscribe\"    |\n      | missing correlation_id      | message.correlation_id                                    | <removed>      |\n      | unknown status              | message.subscribe_response.0.status                       | \"done\"         |\n      | unknown reason code         | message.subscribe_response.0.status_reason_code           | \"rjct.unknown\" |\n      | subscription without code   | message.subscribe_response.0.subscriptions.0.code         | <removed>      |\n      | unknown subscription status | message.subscribe_response.0.subscriptions.0.status       | \"active\"       |\n      | filter severity outside list | message.subscribe_response.0.subscriptions.0.filter.severity | [\"High\"]   |\n","uri":"features/ews_on-subscribe.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
